Cc: Oleksij Rempel <o.rempel@pengutronix.de>
Signed-off-by: Oliver Hartkopp <socketcan@hartkopp.net>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261027-can-rx-lock-v12-1-eb5afc2d8b9b@hartkopp.net
